{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15mini_level_act15mini_st01","groupId":"act15mini","stageId":null,"title":"沉于冰寒","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st01.txt","sourceHash":"1451adcb2920844607ca9a016db2eaf3cb29f83bcbe5004cdbc12c42958cebb6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"乌萨斯，冰原入口，莱特-科钦斯基科考补给站"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——终于到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀，请说出口令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳嗯——哥伦比亚比伦哥，乌萨斯卡特斯多索雷斯，厚罗烧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"口令内容......\n确认。Xорошо，哥伦比亚人。\n发声人......\n确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命，编号CRL005——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（奇特的语调）买买买卖唉艾~哲~伦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎访问莱特-科钦斯基科考补给站。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出笔记本记录）“乌萨斯境内W-K站语音系统轻微受损——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“——暂无维修必要。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽老师的队伍大概带走了一、二、三......二十人份的生存物资？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五人却带了二十人份的东西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出笔记本记录）“物资仅剩百分之五，可供十人使用（已扣除本人将使用的份额），需要重新补给物资。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再让我看看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结构......没有损伤。能源......不用补充。维生设备......还好，温度没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急救包没有使用迹象，门窗也都没有外部破坏的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有最后一项......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站设备）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这条路线没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（确认沿途科考站回传的讯号）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上都是例行汇报，看来没遇上麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g2_colombiaoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"两个月前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哥伦比亚特里蒙市，莱茵生命总部，科学考察科"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就准备出发了，还有什么要交代的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别的应该没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）最后还有一件，但这个你千万别告诉其他人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯嗯，我会保密的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（四处张望）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）马里亚姆主任的队伍在冰原失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！玛丽老师怎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜唔唔唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）小点声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）总之就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）你这次去，搜救主任的队伍是最优先事项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）探索协会那边已经在组织搜救队了，但你也知道，那帮人效率一直不怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科考科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_530_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）主任他们......就只能先靠你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声）我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站设备）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其余站点都没异常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说他们还在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚站传来的讯号？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（操作科考站设备）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起听筒）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里！@#￥比亚站......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们受￥！@%&，需要*......#￥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坐标——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽老师自己发送的讯号，也就是说他本人还在那里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是讯号转到这儿要花不少时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍自己的脸颊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是先做最要紧的事吧，麦哲伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摁下操作台按钮）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"CRL005，麦哲伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"身份已确认，有什么我可以帮到您的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将近三个月的讯号收发记录加密传输回哥伦比亚，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"装置","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已确认，开始加密回传至信使站点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（关闭操作台）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探索协会设立的基站和乌萨斯通用，还挺方便的，申请借道进入冰原的入境许可也容易多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等乌萨斯的信使先生过来确认完文件就该出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽老师，您可别碰上什么大麻烦，我马上就来帮您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还真快......请您稍等一下，我马上来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薇恩塔·麦哲伦小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是伊万先生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，和往常一样，例行公事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这就给您开门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，伊万先生，您要先进来休息下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您应该知道规矩，麦哲伦小姐，我只要再往前走半步，就足够让哥伦比亚人找我们麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不说，我不说，不会有人知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的小机器盯得可紧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些系统还没智能到您想象的那个程度呢，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"和哥伦比亚人打交道，小心点不会错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我相信您是个实在的人，不会给我们添麻烦。但谨慎起见，还是请您允许我拒绝您的邀请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，请出示文件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该都在这里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......入境许可......探险许可......探险路线确认书......地图绘制委托......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，麦哲伦小姐，您的文件没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我有一个不幸的消息要告诉您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"今年所有的冰原考察许可都被取消了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，但是，文件应该都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您应该也不是第一次碰到这种事情了，请理解一下我们的苦衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我有很急的事情一定要进冰原，您、您能不能通融一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您不妨把急事说给我听，或许我能帮您想个法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情是这样的，我们有支队伍在冰原里失踪了，我得想办法找到他们，至少确认他们的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是攸关人命的大事，您要是有什么条件，可以直接告诉我，只要能让我先去救人，我什么都能答应您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这您应该通过官方渠道反映，等待我国的救援队行动，而不是这样冒失地一个人出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，我都明白，可官方救援队行动总得要时间准备，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是个探险家，对冰原的情况还算熟悉，能早一天找到他们，之后的救援都会更方便些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我了解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，您方便透露一下失踪人员的坐标吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？可、可以的，请稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就在这个位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）我拿到哥伦比亚人的坐标了，从地点上看，北边的事应该和他们有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）这个小姑娘怎么处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）听说她是哥伦比亚的资深探险家，我们需要确认她对于哥伦比亚的重要程度。盯着她，等待进一步指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的同僚们确认过了，抱歉，麦哲伦小姐，我们还是不能让您从这里去北边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"前方都被军事管制了，即使是我也过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但作为补偿，我会与您同行。只要是在乌萨斯境内，您想去哪里都可以，我以乌萨斯官方人员的身份，可以为您行个方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，萨米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走萨米进冰原的话，是不是就不会被封锁了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"理论上来说，是的。但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就先去萨米！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经准备好了，麻烦您现在就带我去，伊万先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）她想从萨米进冰原，你们那边调查的时间够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）随她的意就行，调查一个有公开身份的哥伦比亚人用不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）到了边境，边防军会派人接手你的差事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）当心点，别被“女巫”盯上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，如您所愿，麦哲伦小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，请留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你有疑问，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的长官，关于......我们的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你对军队的安排有疑虑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不敢，长官。我只是觉得，对待萨米人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你怜悯那些动物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的长官，我认为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"您刚刚，说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解你的同情心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"让我问你一个问题吧，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，你是一位农场主的儿子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，在你家的土地上，驮兽们繁衍，拉车，在你父亲的意志下创造价值......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"没有你父亲的驯养，它们自己会有这种想法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不会，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那你凭什么认为萨米人会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"可，长官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯人推翻骏鹰统治之后，用了千年将自己的土地改造成乌萨斯所需要的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"而萨米，仍是一片荒林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"对于文明，萨米人毫无益处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信一些萨米人经过适当的点拨能够理解乌萨斯的苦心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为他们带去文明之火，他们应当感激涕零。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"而萨米人的反应，我想不需要我多说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"他们听不懂文明的劝导，只知道弱肉强食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，暴力就是必要之恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"当他们的后代住上坚固的房屋，享受乌萨斯带来的文化与产物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"他们终究会理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，长官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“斥候”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"报告，前方发现萨米人，正与邪魔交战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"列队，让术师队伍准备好源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“斥候”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是不听劝的驮兽，你也不希望他们被饥饿的野兽生吞活剥吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“长官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"全体都有，准备进攻邪魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“士兵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——是，长官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一周后，萨乌边境"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"再向前走一段路，就能到边防军边境哨所，继续往前走，就是萨米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我的护送到那里为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一路上多亏有您在，和乌萨斯人的交流顺畅多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您的乌萨斯语也说得不错，如果没有口音，那就更完美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个啊，感觉一时半会儿也改不了，嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我还有好多要学的，伊万先生有时候说的话我一句都听不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我们小地方的方言，乌萨斯人都不一定能听懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"要是下次您来的时候日程不那么紧迫，我可以教您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？谢谢谢谢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，您对萨米熟悉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没走过从萨米进冰原的路线呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说穿过萨米本身需要的补给和进入冰原需要的补给是相等的，而且冰原上靠近萨米的科考站更少，补给不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得是，那是个野蛮的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生好像不太喜欢萨米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的边境哨所一般都会有驻军，然而萨米与乌萨斯边境，只有边防军定期巡逻而没有据点驻防。您知道是什么原因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯......是和萨米有什么矛盾吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"矛盾？萨米人侵占乌萨斯的领土，袭击乌萨斯的士兵，只为了满足他们原始邪恶的念头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我们前面的哨所，曾经被萨米人无端霸占，乌萨斯好心帮助他们击退邪魔后才向他们提出抗议，希望能够收回领土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"可他们却坚决不离开，还要伤害我们乌萨斯的军人。我们最后别无他法，只能动用武力驱逐他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是这样......吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"野蛮的萨米人为了复仇，派出了一个被我们叫作“女巫”的冤魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"她杀死了这座哨所里所有的乌萨斯士兵，而后一直在萨乌边境上游荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"遇见人数少的队伍，她就用暴风雪围困他们，并趁机杀害；遇见乌萨斯的重兵，她就躲在风雪中不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"除不掉，又赶不走，很是烦人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"最终，我们只能采取精锐小队巡查边境的方式巩固边防，防止萨米人继续造成破坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您路过萨米的时候，也一定要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"他们一见到外人，不撕裂喉咙，不啜饮鲜血，是不会停手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"就像对付雪原上集群的野兽，我们只能诉诸武力，让他们不敢轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您明白了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"外头起风了，我们快进哨所休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物还在吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米萨满","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它被驱逐了，我们应该安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，乌萨斯的朋友！你们那边的情况如何？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这边没有出现伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅，你那儿还有水吗？给我们的乌萨斯朋友带些过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米萨满","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，刚才可太险了，要不是你们帮上一把，我们这就得有几个小雏羽去见先祖咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要在意，那是我们共同的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一会准备去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我们正在执行军务，只是恰好路过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们乌萨斯人真是古板，刚刚和邪魔打过一架，还想着什么军务军务的，你的弟兄们也累得够呛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到我们的营地里来，休息会，烤烤火吃点肉干再上路也不迟，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就......恭敬不如从命了，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，有什么好客气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅，水呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米萨满","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还在给伤员包扎呢，你等一会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用拿水了，让我们的朋友直接去营地喝个够！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒檀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再确认一下有没有其他的邪魔，我就先带伤员和乌萨斯朋友们回去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我处理好就回来。记得在树下给我留个位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少不了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起来吧小子们，回家喽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯士兵听令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"列队，前进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，真的是哨所吗？里面好宽阔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有正中那棵树，伊万先生，乌萨斯人有在建筑中间种树的习俗吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那是萨米人栽的，已经枯死很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好在这棵树的树干足够结实，在雪原中也是难得的屏障，与其砍了做木柴，不如就让它那样竖着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方圆百里明明没有一棵树，他们是怎么把这一棵栽到雪原中来的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这我并不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以......采些样本吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）我们到枯树哨所了，女巫没来找我们麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）我们也查明了，这个女孩没什么背景，而且在冰原上还有一些可利用的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）边防军会尽快向你的位置靠拢，接收到这个女孩后会直接转交给调查队，他们需要一个熟悉冰原情况的向导。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）后续的事情不再需要你处理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）收到，我先去准备信标，随时联系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）抱歉了，小家伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，“朋友”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在做什么，把武器放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我的职责，便是为皇帝陛下开疆拓土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"从今往后，这里就是乌萨斯的领土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你、你究竟什么意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我说得不够明白吗，野蛮人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是方圆百里唯一的聚居点，占领了这里，伟大的乌萨斯自然就成为了此地的主宰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"这是乌萨斯的领土，请你们离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这片土地上生活了那么久，你就在这插了个旗子，凭什么说这里属于你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们来了，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......念在我们共同对抗过邪魔的情分上，我给你们两个选择，离开这里，或者成为乌萨斯的子民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的族人都是优秀的战士，乌萨斯很乐意接纳你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你们要讲乌萨斯语，穿乌萨斯的服饰，最重要的是，停止你们那骇人听闻的异端信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米萨满","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（默念咒语）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"术师，让那个女巫闭嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米萨满","speakerId":"avg_npc_965_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蕾雅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不要做傻事，也不要想着抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨米语）老树啊，请为我见证......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨米战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你让我没得选择，“朋友”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"全体都有，进攻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）请说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）边防军那边风向不太对，暴风雪可能要来了，你先去空地上布置信标引导他们前进，接触后直接带目标一起离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯方言）收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"您采完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这棵树的性状太神奇了。从生物学上来说它确实已经完全枯萎，但我总觉得它好像还有一部分活得好好的，真奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是研究透说不定能发表一篇大文章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那想必是学界的一大幸事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"暴风雪快来了，您还是先去哨所内避一避吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生不进去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去看一下暴风雪的规模，这样万一风雪大得超出预期，还有机会向附近的人求援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请先喝口这个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚热了些水，您先喝一杯暖和下身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊万","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，我很快就回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g11_wsafehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生在外头工作，我一个人躲在建筑里烤火，这样是不是不太合适......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说我也是个探险家，遇到困难怎么能让同伴一个人去面对呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（望向窗外）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，脸好疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风速越来越快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生，您要小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对，那是？！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风暴掀起雪浪，朝着哨所的方向涌来。\n然而，它们像是听到号令般控制着速度，缓缓向前推进。\n这并非因距离产生的视觉误差，而是风雪本身正在听从旨意。\n在得到允诺前，它们不敢让雪花逾越施令者。\n而她，此时正在风雪前方，高举权杖，缓缓向着哨所走来。\n一步，又一步。\n平稳，坚定，不容置疑。\n直到风雪淹没大地——\n事情或许是这样发生的，但在冰原边境，麦哲伦比任何人都希望看到这一幕。\n因为那位行走在冰雪之间的女性，可是她在冰原上最好的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g11_wsafehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"当这句话传到远方时，麦哲伦明显感觉到，风雪似乎没有那么强劲了。\n而当西蒙娜走到麦哲伦面前，她身后的雪浪也在不知不觉间消失得无影无踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，麦哲伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你应该去冰原探险了，怎么会想到要来这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯又把进冰原的路给封啦，但我敬重的老师在探索冰原时失踪了，我无论如何都得去，所以只好绕个远路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我热了些茶水你要喝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就谢谢你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嘟......咕嘟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你是要从萨米进冰原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我记得西蒙娜姐是萨米人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都已经遇上了，哪还有不帮你的道理呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那等伊万先生回来，我和他告个别，我们就可以进萨米了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我听说，萨米有些原始，还很可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......那位乌萨斯信使是这么和你说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还说这里会有女巫出没，会不由分说地袭击别人，要我小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯人就是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得，那个女巫是个什么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得她......有点可怜，就像这棵树一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。伊万先生好像很厌恶萨米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他的用词听上去很中肯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们萨米人也一样厌恶乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么呢？有误会的话，大家不能好好聊一聊解开它吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为在他们眼里，征服远比理解有效率得多。他们眼里只有一个扰人的女巫，可是无数萨米人已经被——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——时候不早了，你说你的信使朋友往哪里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北方，暴风雪来的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里等着，我去帮他一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是一起去比较——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麦哲伦，待在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里更安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上小心，西蒙娜姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心，呃，当心女巫哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，她要是出现的话，我会离她远远的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会再帮我热杯茶好吗，麦哲伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又只剩下我一个人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生和西蒙娜姐要是遇上了，真的能好好相处吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得呢，大树先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"亘古的枯树以沉默作为它的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是不太能够理解，为什么能够一起对抗敌人，却非得因为其他事兵戎相见呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作......不全是正确的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"悠久的枯树思考了一阵，决定以枯枝间的碰撞作答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢，大树先生？您也是因为不能被别人理解，所以才独自来到这雪原上的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"挺立的枯树觉得这个问题不太好回答，于是它选择保持沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得对......这是个蠢问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，可以的话，我还是希望......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，这是你的热茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊万先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你说的位置找了一圈，没能找到你提到的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北方的风雪近在咫尺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，他已经呼叫援救，和乌萨斯边防军会合，就地避难了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的哨所不够坚固，这个规模的暴风雪，会把整栋建筑压溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们或许也要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能......再等一会吗，伊万先生是个很有经验的信使，我们也认识很久了，这样的暴风雪是不会困住他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你坚持的话，那我们就再等一会好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去和老树报个平安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老树......西蒙娜姐，你是，这一带的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经的职责，就是护卫恒常的老树。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它跨越了死亡，但没能被铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这一切，只是因为我们一时的热心肠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"付出善意，收获恶意，这片大地就是如此行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，女巫......才会在这里游荡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间差不多了，我们再不走，就要被困在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找个背风的地方，给伊万先生留个记号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少得让他知道我安全离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这样应该就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要离开了，伊万先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，麦哲伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和西蒙娜姐一起走，风雪都会变得很温驯呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是略懂一些法术而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你肩膀上的这个通讯器......总觉得在哪里见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个？这个是我从乌萨斯人那里买来的，效果不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算啦，哥伦比亚的通讯器比乌萨斯的好用多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麦哲伦","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有件事......我想和你道个歉......希望你不要生气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来听听。"},{"type":"narration","text":"呃，之前，在哨所里的时候，我一时兴奋，在大树先生身上采了样本。\n你伤害了老树？\n没、没有，是这样的，我本来的确是想打孔采样的，但在我碰到它的时候，大树先生直接掉了两块树皮下来。\n所以我，我真的没有——\n树皮？\n是的，请不要生气，我没有在树上乱刻乱画。\n能让我......看一下树皮吗？\n欸？好，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"（尝试将两块树皮拼接在一起）\n（姬缇娅......）\n（海丽儿？）\n（......）\n（谢谢，谢谢您。）\n西蒙娜姐，怎么了？\n没事......\n这两块树皮，你就留下吧，老树不会责怪你的。\n喔。\n谢谢老树。\n是啊，赞美老树。\n风雪快来了，我们得加紧找个合适的地方过夜。\n走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
